<title>POLAND: Mostostal-W Q1 net rises to PLN 1.5 mln.</title>
<headline>Mostostal-W Q1 net rises to PLN 1.5 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mostostal Warszawa SA preliminary results for the first quarter of the year ending March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q1 1997	Q1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit		     2.21   vs    1.04</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			 2.40   vs    1.25</p>
<p>    net profit			     1.47   vs    0.86</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Mostostal Warszawa SA</p>
<p>    net sales			     45.07   vs   18.84</p>
<p>    costs of sales			43.41   vs   16.62</p>
<p>    extraordinary loss		   0.05   vs    0.01</p>
<p>    income tax			     0.93   vs    0.34</p>
<p>    other taxes				na   vs	na</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   0.32   vs    0.32</p>
<p>    financial costs			0.07   vs    0.09</p>
<p>    investment			     2.15   vs    1.03</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
